### (场景: 比对需求申明和当前配置间差异) 生成当前模块运行时配置与指定的需求中系统配置部分的差异
POST http://{{baseurl}}/dcm/config/diff
Content-Type: application/yaml
Accept: application/yaml;charset=utf-8

schemaVersion: 1.0
requests:
  - provider: DICT
    isPartialMode: true
    requirements:
      - configType: DictType
        version: '1.0'
        isMandatory: true
        vargs:
          - code: TypeA
            remark: Type A
          - code: TypeB
            remark: Type B
      - configType: DictEntry
        isMandatory: true
        kwargs:
          dictType: TypeA
        vargs:
          - item1
          - item2
          - item3
      - configType: DictEntry
        isMandatory: false
        tenants: all
        kwargs:
          dictType: TypeB
        vargs:
          - item1
          - item2
          - item3



### (场景: 比对需求申明和当前配置间差异) 生成当前模块运行时配置与指定的需求中租户部分的差异
POST http://{{baseurl}}/dcm/config/diff?tenant=1
Content-Type: application/yaml
Accept: application/yaml;charset=utf-8

schemaVersion: 1.0
requests:
  - provider: DICT
    isPartialMode: true
    requirements:
      - configType: DictType
        version: '1.0'
        isMandatory: true
        vargs:
          - TypeA
          - TypeB
      - configType: DictEntry
        isMandatory: true
        kwargs:
          dictType: TypeA
        vargs:
          - item1
          - item2
          - item3
      - configType: DictEntry
        isMandatory: false
        tenants: all
        kwargs:
          dictType: TypeB
        vargs:
          - item1
          - item2
          - item3


### (应用场景: 模块内部初始化配置) 应用模块内置的对本模块的配置申明
POST http://{{baseurl}}/dcm/config/apply
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "schemaVersion": "1.0",
  "requests": [{
    "provider": "DICT",
    "isPartialMode": true,
    "useBuiltinConfig": true
  }]
}

###(应用场景: 使用外部的配置申明进行配置初始化) 应用配置申明(外部指定配置)
POST http://{{baseurl}}/dcm/config/diff
Content-Type: application/yaml
Accept: application/yaml;application/yaml;charset=utf-8

schemaVersion: 1.0
requests:
  - provider: DICT
    isPartialMode: true
    useBuiltinConfig: false
    requirements:
      - configType: DictType  # 需要的配置能力类型
        version: 1.0 # 配置能力描述使用的版本号
        vargs: ["TypeA", "TypeB", "TypeC"]
      - configType: DictEntry  # 系统字典配置
        kwargs:
          dictType: TypeA
        vargs: ["item1", "item2", "item3"]
      - configType: DictEntry  # 数据字典
        isMandatory: True
        tenants: 1
        kwargs:
          dictType: TypeB
        vargs: ["item3", "item4", "item5"]
      - configType: DictEntry  # 级联字典
        isMandatory: True
        tenants: 1
        kwargs:
          dictType: TypeC
          isCascade: True
        vargs: ["item1", "item2", "item3"]
      - configType: DictEntry  # removal
        isRemoval: true
        kwargs:
          dictType: TypeA
        vargs: ["item4"]



###(应用场景: 使用外部的配置申明进行配置初始化，全量模式） 应用配置申明(外部指定配置)
POST http://{{baseurl}}/dcm/config/diff
Content-Type: application/yaml
Accept: application/yaml;application/yaml;charset=utf-8

schemaVersion: 1.0
requests:
  - provider: DICT
    isPartialMode: True
    requirements:
      - configType: "DictType"
        version: "1.0"
        isMandatory: true
        isRemoval: false
        vargs:
          - code: "message-notice-type"
            remark: "消息通知方式"
      - configType: "DictEntry"
        version: "1.0"
        isMandatory: true
        isSystem: true
        isRemoval: false
        kwargs:
          isCascade: "false"
          dictType: "visualization-modelType"
        vargs:
          - label: "UE5"
            key: "unreal-engine-five"
            description: "模型类型-UE5"
          - label: "二维组态"
            key: "two-dimensional-config"
            description: "模型类型-二维组态"
      - configType: "DictEntry"
        version: "1.0"
        isMandatory: true
        isSystem: true
        isRemoval: false
        kwargs:
          isCascade: "false"
          dictType: "message-notice-type"
        vargs:
          - label: "站内通知"
            key: "CHANNEL_SITE"
            description: "站内信消息"
          - label: "短信通知"
            key: "CHANNEL_SMS"
            description: "短信消息"
          - label: "app通知"
            key: "CHANNEL_APP"
            description: "app消息"
          - label: "语音通知"
            key: "CHANNEL_VOICE"
            description: "语音通知"

### 应用当前全量系统配置
POST http://{{baseurl}}/dcm/config/diff
Content-Type: application/yaml
Accept: application/yaml;application/yaml;charset=utf-8

requests:
  - provider: "DICT"
    isPartialMode: false
    requirements:
      - configType: "DictType"
        version: "1.0"
        isMandatory: true
        isSystem: true
        isRemoval: false
        vargs:
          - code: "file-minio-bucket"
            remark: "minio桶名称"
          - code: "project-merchant-area"
            remark: "上海二期迁移-区域类型"
          - code: "project-merchant-spaceAttr"
            remark: "上海二期迁移-空间属性"
          - code: "project-merchant-spaceTradeModel"
            remark: "上海二期迁移-经营类型"
          - code: "project-merchant-storeType"
            remark: "上海二期迁移-档位类型"
          - code: "project-merchant-vehicleType"
            remark: "上海二期迁移-车辆类型"
          - code: "project-merchant-evaluate_level"
            remark: "上海二期迁移-评价分类"
          - code: "message-notice-type"
            remark: "消息通知方式"
          - code: "project-merchant-protocolType"
            remark: "上海二期迁移-协议类型"
          - code: "att-face-recognition"
            remark: "人脸识别服务"
          - code: "property-abnormal-type"
            remark: "资产异常类型"
          - code: "risk-source-type"
            remark: "风险源分类"
      - configType: "DictEntry"
        version: "1.0"
        isMandatory: true
        isSystem: true
        isRemoval: false
        kwargs:
          isCascade: "false"
          parent: ""
          dictType: "visualization-modelType"
        vargs:
          - label: "UE5"
            key: "unreal-engine-five"
            description: "模型类型-UE5"
          - label: "二维组态"
            key: "two-dimensional-config"
            description: "模型类型-二维组态"
      - configType: "DictEntry"
        version: "1.0"
        isMandatory: true
        isSystem: true
        isRemoval: false
        kwargs:
          isCascade: "false"
          parent: ""
          dictType: "file-minio-bucket"
        vargs:
          - label: "visualconflg"
            key: "VISUALCONFIG"
            description: "可视化中心bucket"
      - configType: "DictEntry"
        version: "1.0"
        isMandatory: true
        isSystem: true
        isRemoval: false
        kwargs:
          isCascade: "false"
          parent: ""
          dictType: "message-notice-type"
        vargs:
          - label: "站内通知"
            key: "CHANNEL_SITE"
            description: "站内信消息"
          - label: "短信通知"
            key: "CHANNEL_SMS"
            description: "短信消息"


          - label: "app通知"
            key: "CHANNEL_APP"
            description: "app消息"
          - label: "语音通知"
            key: "CHANNEL_VOICE"
            description: "语音通知"


### 应用/DIFF当前租户配置配置
#POST http://{{baseurl}}/dcm/config/diff?tenant=1
#Content-Type: application/yaml
#Accept: application/yaml;charset=utf-8
POST http://{{baseurl}}/dcm/config/diff?tenant=1
Content-Type: application/yaml
Accept: application/yaml;application/yaml;charset=utf-8


schemaVersion: "1.0"
requests:
  - provider: "DICT"
    isPartialMode: false
    requirements:
      - configType: "DictEntry"
        isMandatory: true
        isRemoval: false
        tenants:
          - "all"
        kwargs:
          parent: ""
          isCascade: "false"
          dictType: "project-merchant-spaceAttr"
        vargs:
          - label: "档位"
            key: "spaceAttr_booth"
          - label: "车位"
            key: "spaceAttr_parking"
      - configType: "DictEntry"
        isMandatory: true
        isRemoval: false
        tenants:
          - "all"
        kwargs:
          parent: ""
          isCascade: "false"
          dictType: "project-merchant-spaceTradeModel"
        vargs:
          - label: "运营"
            key: "spaceTradeModel_operation"
          - label: "自用"
            key: "spaceTradeModel_personal"
          - label: "公用"
            key: "spaceTradeModel_public"
      - configType: "DictEntry"
